  {
   "say": "Jordan, nineteen seventy. PLO factions built a state inside the state.",
   "gap": 0.2,
   "screen": "Jordan, *1970:* a state inside the state",
   "at": "L1",
   "until": "L2-0.1"
  },
  {
   "say": "They shot at the King, and blew up three hijacked airliners.",
   "gap": 0.2,
   "screen": "*3* hijacked airliners, blown up",
   "screen_icon": "✈️",
   "at": "L2:blew",
   "until": "L3-0.1"
  },
  {
   "say": "Jordan's army struck back. Thousands died, many Palestinian civilians. By seventy-one, the PLO was out.",
   "gap": 0.2,
   "screen": "*Thousands* died, many Palestinian civilians",
   "at": "L3:thousands",
   "until": "L3:by-0.1"
  },
  {
   "say": "Then Lebanon. Its south became Fatahland.",
   "gap": 0.2,
   "screen": "Lebanon: *Fatahland*",
   "at": "L4:fatahland",
   "until": "L5-0.1"
  },
  {
   "say": "Civil war, many sides, the PLO among them.",
   "gap": 0.2,
   "screen": "Civil war, *1975.* Many sides.",
   "at": "L5",
   "until": "L6-0.1"
  },
  {
   "say": "In nineteen eighty-two, after Israel invaded, it left Beirut by sea.",
   "gap": 0.35
  },
  {
   "say": "Then Kuwait, nineteen ninety. Arafat backed Saddam Hussein's invasion.",
   "gap": 0.2,
   "screen": "Kuwait, *1990:* Arafat backs Saddam",
   "at": "L7",
   "until": "L8-0.1"
  },
  {
   "say": "Families paid for that choice.",
   "gap": 0.2
  },
  {
   "say": "Over three hundred fifty thousand Palestinians lived there. By ninety-two, under fifty thousand.",
   "gap": 0.2
  },
  {
   "say": "Egypt said Gaza's tunnels served Sinai militants, and flooded them in twenty fifteen.",
   "gap": 0.2,
   "screen": "Egypt floods Gaza's tunnels, *2015*",
   "screen_icon": "🌊",
   "at": "L10:flooded",
   "until": "L11-0.1"
  },
  {
   "say": "Gaza: Israel left in two thousand five. Two years later, HAMAS took it by force.",
   "gap": 0.2
  },
  {
   "say": "A hundred sixty-one killed in one week.",
   "gap": 0.2
  },
  {
   "say": "HAMAS: Sunni, but armed by Iran's Shi'a regime.",
   "gap": 0.3,
   "screen": "Sunni group. *Shi'a* sponsor: Iran.",
   "at": "L13",
   "until": "L14-0.1"
  },
  {
